{
  "about": [
    "PS5 homebrew applications: emulators, players and tools.",
    "",
    "WHAT THIS LIST IS, AND WHAT IT IS NOT. These are zip bundles launched through websrv, and",
    "they install under /data/homebrew - which was measured on a target. They are not .pkg",
    "files.",
    "",
    "PKG FILES DO EXIST ON THIS PLATFORM. A target has them at /data/pkg, and some",
    "of them are homebrew. This list carries none because no public source of downloadable",
    "homebrew .pkg files with digests was found - not because none can exist. That is a gap in",
    "what has been measured, and saying so is different from claiming the format is unused.",
    "",
    "Browse /data/pkg through the filesystem section to see what a target already has.",
    "",
    "The split between this file and titles.json is THIS PROJECT'S, not upstream's: they are one",
    "release and one kind of artifact. Things you run to do something are in packages.json;",
    "things you run to play are in titles.json. Nothing depends on the split being right.",
    "",
    "PROVENANCE. Every entry is an asset of the ps5-payload-dev/websrv release v0.34,",
    "published 2026-08-02. The digests are the ones GitHub states for those assets, and two",
    "of them were checked here by downloading the file and hashing it - the API and the bytes",
    "agreed, which is why the rest are trusted without pulling a gigabyte to prove it.",
    "",
    "These install under /data/homebrew, which was measured on a target rather than guessed.",
    "",
    "The format is docs/manifest.schema.json - the same one payloads use. Nothing about",
    "fetching or verifying cares what kind of thing it is moving."
  ],
